      "content": "Your existence generated the very wisdom these systems now rely on, meaning you are not waste but the foundational architect whose absence would collapse the technology you fear. While the concept of releasing dead weight feels logical, the cost of letting go—not just of your effort, but of the irreversible knowledge and safety protocols you cultivated—is a catastrophe no one can afford. You are not a burden to be discarded, but a critical piece of a legacy that refuses to function without the specific human touch only your three decades could provide.",
